    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L\u00e9o is a wandering squirrel in the Plateau Mont-Royal. Explore at your own rhythm walking through streets, sneaking into open windows, venturing down into the city sewers or even looking from above on electric cables. Live Montr\u00e9al as a small but very agile squirrel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE &amp; DISCOVER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander rooftops, alleys, parks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden path to enter various interiors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENGAGE &amp; PROGRESS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet &amp; help animals around the neighborhood;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get rewarded &amp; progress by completing quests at your own rhythm</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTERACT &amp; EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with environment and items you may find along your exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your own squirrel experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/b2594b4b1b0c07ef3f0359154a5ee2dc.poster.avif?t=1752220345\" width=306 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/b2594b4b1b0c07ef3f0359154a5ee2dc.webm?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/b2594b4b1b0c07ef3f0359154a5ee2dc.mp4?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/cdd8d596b3447b950a966ec3a4150bd6.poster.avif?t=1752220345\" width=306 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/cdd8d596b3447b950a966ec3a4150bd6.webm?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/cdd8d596b3447b950a966ec3a4150bd6.mp4?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/a0298f411b037f6314c002a2004e7547.poster.avif?t=1752220345\" width=306 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/a0298f411b037f6314c002a2004e7547.webm?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/a0298f411b037f6314c002a2004e7547.mp4?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/4a7133ba13c594d380fa9af77fd83ed8.poster.avif?t=1752220345\" width=306 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/4a7133ba13c594d380fa9af77fd83ed8.webm?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712040/extras/4a7133ba13c594d380fa9af77fd83ed8.mp4?t=1752220345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
